<span id="A2.T2.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><em id="A2.T2.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">Silent</em><span id="A2.T2.2.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> CoT example response excerpt</span></span>
</span></th></tr>
</thead>
